cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DicomRtNiftiConverterGUI: a cross-platform DICOM-RT to NIfTI conversion toolkit"
abstract: >-
  A cross-platform .NET 8 toolkit that converts DICOM radiotherapy data - CT/MR/PT image
  series, RT Structures and RT Dose - to NIfTI, and performs the reverse conversion
  (mask to RTSTRUCT, NIfTI to DICOM image series). It ships as an Avalonia desktop GUI
  and a headless CLI sharing one core conversion library, and its contour rasterization
  is validated against analytic ground truth in continuous integration.
type: software
authors:
